# Task: Create a service account

A new internal daemon will run on this system under a dedicated service account.

Create the system account `{{username}}` with all of the following attributes:

- UID: `{{uid}}` (a system UID)
- Primary group: a system group named `{{username}}`
- Home directory: `{{home_dir}}` (the directory must exist)
- A shell that prevents interactive login
- No usable password

The account is for a daemon only; it must never be able to log in interactively.
